{"v":4,"catch":"把獸人踢開！","desc":"《TECMO KNIGHT》是TECMO於1989年發行的一款動作遊戲。\n操控兩名決心直面噴火野獸、震動大地、惡魔肆虐的荒原的惡魔使者，面對激烈展開的詛咒之戰。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-05-02","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/48404811b2bbd21b31bd60bb7cff5edc5ac98305922b60c8d11f12431416c771.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2ff634fc0406df728bed7192252e9eae367ccfa8275408851fb4e44c5f1584d2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cccceb41854825d6203028b5e8e2f5f74c042efa0b3be03a0ad2db1be9caa360.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e13f6e3d95ef33ca161d024a1bc083cbe4c98973d525f1c76a62101234b0da14.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/21e869584e2127b9fa67a4d78af6f58caf91ec67413b4bd49e299e9a046a1f7d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2c610a5064fe1336b60725015f9dfc179a7dc5eeb183edd166e44cc23bcef5ba.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ba201ab14000","dlc":[]}